OL,5,G0350 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1985, one the world's most
OL,7,     Frecognisable fashion accessories
OL,8,     Fwas first launched, the Birkin
OL,9,     Fbag. It was named after the singer
OL,10,     Fand actor Jane Birkin who inspired
OL,11,     Fthe design.
